"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T15:00:04-07:00","id":222477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windrave</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/205274-stigmatic-and-demon-blooded-character-sheets?p=220288#post220288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Stigmatics are Mortals with unseen sense: Godmachine. Latents are mortals who may later become an offspring or Fractal when exposed to something that would ordinarily make them a stigmatic.<br /> <br /> There needs to be a field for a learned list of Embeds, keys and interlocks on both offspring and Fractals.<br /> <br /> Both require an entry to describe a single stigmata (permanant brand).<br /> <br /> You may want to put an aether pool entry on the fractal sheet (max 5) in the chance they player has purchased the merit to use it. Elsewise, proceed as normal GMC mortal char sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool. Thanks! I have someone else who is working on some write-ups too. I appreciate the help!<br /> <br /> Should I have some questions once I start, I may hit you guys up. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Characte