ew Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One line should be fine, maybe two depending on the length of each line.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I'll see what I can do then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T15:03:31-07:00","id":277583,"title":"","content":"Ok, take a look and see what you think. Hope this will work. I left a section for Breaking Points on page 2, but if it's needed, let me know.... Think I covered everything else though. If you think it's done, then I'll list it on the site.<br /> <br /> Heres the link: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/DtD/NWoD_GodMachine_Fractal_Offspring_Latent_2-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T02:06:37-07:00","id":278684,"title":"","content":"I could be wrong but don't Fractals have an Aether pool?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T03:33:28-07:00","id":278705,"title":"","content":"They could have if they buy the merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T04:09:31-07:00","id":278731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hawthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/205274-stigmatic-and-demon-blooded-character-sheets?p=278684#post278684\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could be wrong but don't Fractals have an Aether pool?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most don't, but they can buy a Merit that gives them a five-point Aether pool. Which Mr. Gone has on the sheet now!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/205274-stigmatic-and-demon-blooded-character-sheets?p=277583#post277583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, take a look and see what you think. Hope this will work. I left a section for Breaking Points on page 2, but if it's needed, let me know.... Think I covered everything else though. If you think it's done, then I'll list it on the site.<br /> <br /> Heres the link: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/DtD/NWoD_GodMachine_Fractal_Offspring_Latent_2-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly good, but the section on Interlocks isn't very helpful. If it were just lines for the name of each Interlock, then you'd only need three lines, because you can't have a fourth Interlock (under normal rules); if it's meant to contain the rules for each, it's entirely too short. I don't know how much work it would be to fit everything you'd need into the second page, but my recommendation would be to use the Interlock block from the normal Demon sheet, the one that takes up like half the second page. Just listing the names of the Interlocks is really unhelpful because they're custom powers and you can't just look the name up in a book.<br /> <br /> Demon-blooded do in fact have Integrity breaking points like normal mortals. You can probably get away with leaving space for them on the sheet out if you have to, though; breaking points are relatively freeform.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T15:01:32-07:00","id":279087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/205274-stigmatic-and-demon-blooded-character-sheets?p=278731#post278731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mostly good, but the section on Interlocks isn't very helpful. If it were just lines for the name of each Interlock, then you'd only need three lines, because you can't have a fourth Interlock (under normal rules); if it's meant to contain the rules for each, it's entirely too short. I don't know how much work it would be to fit everything you'd need into the second page, but my recommendation would be to use the Interlock block from the normal Demon sheet, the one that takes up like half the second page. Just listing the names of the Interlocks is really unhelpful because they're custom powers and you can't just look the name up in a book.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah, wish I'd known that sooner. But, I'll just redesign the whole thing then. I was under the assumption that block was needed, since the Demon sheet has it(whats the point of that chart then anyway?).<br /> <br /> If it need that big of a section for Interlocks, then it throws out just having a 2 pager, as that won't fit the standard two page design, unless I ditch the extra merits and maybe breaking points....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/205274-stigmatic-and-demon-blooded-character-sheets?p=278731#post278731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demon-blooded do in fact have Integrity breaking points like normal mortals. You can probably get away with leaving space for them on the sheet out if you have to, though; breaking points are relatively freeform.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm....Maybe I just need to make it a one page sheet, and then have an add on for Interlocks and Embeds? Or just have that as a second page, but without the history and all that...? I dunno...have to see what I can come up with...<br /> <br /> Thanks for the help thus far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 10-12-2014, 08:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T17:08:38-07:00","id":280271,"title":"","content":"Ok, had some time to think about it, and I think I have a layout that will work that still stays within that 2 page format...<br /> <br /> Check this out and see if this is better:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/DtD/NWoD_GodMachine_Fractal_Offspring_Latent_2-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/goog